DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
       ffuuttiimmeess()  changes  the  access and modification times of a file in the
       same way as uuttiimmeess(2), with the difference that the  file  whose  time‐
       stamps are to be changed is specified via a file descriptor, _f_d, rather
       than via a pathname.

       lluuttiimmeess()  changes  the  access and modification times of a file in the
       same way as uuttiimmeess(2), with the difference that if  _p_a_t_h  refers  to  a
       symbolic  link,  then  the link is not dereferenced: instead, the time‐
       stamps of the symbolic link are changed.

